          ],
          "content": "The distance between the Sun and Saturn is 14,33,50,00,00,000 m $1 . 4 3 3 5 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 2 }   \\mathrm { m }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.4,
            0.848,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": "The distance between Saturn and Uranus is 14,39,00,00,00,000 m $= 1 . 4 3 9 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 2 }$ m. The distance between the Sun and Earth is $1 , 4 9 , 6 0 , 0 0 , 0 0 , 0 0 0 \\; \\mathrm { m } = 1 . 4 9 6 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 1 } \\; \\mathrm { m }$"
        },
        {
